{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_05",
  "title": "Moonlight",
  "storyCode": "LE-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fc98aad5bae274048fa780e0ba7043bcd7e87004fd3f13712a0f8936abeb3cb5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How do you feel? All better now, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm fine..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm totally fine, I'm sure of it. The both of us are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm going out for a bit, so stay put here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're going out again the moment you feel a little better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got work to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's fine and all, but shouldn't you at least wait until you've recovered?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry about me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hibiscus said the same thing. After you wake up, it'd be best to keep resting for a while and monitoring your condition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's an emergency, one that can't wait. Alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, there's not a whole lot of time left until the concert. I think the most important to do until then is to make sure you're healthy and well-practiced... I'm sure that's what you want too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you stop pestering me with that right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pestering?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not what I meant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I have to go, so don't get in my way. I'll be back as soon as I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you really... can't tell me what you're going to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If everything goes well... you'll know soon enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh right, your suit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I made an appointment to pick it up this afternoon, but I won't be able to go with you. You should go get it yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Remember to bring your cello with you and play a little passage as you're trying it on. Make sure there aren't any areas that feel uncomfortable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, it's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm here to ask you to put this concert on hold. Or at least, don't let Ebenholz and Kreide play together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What did you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something terrible is going to happen in the Afterglow if those two play together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So if what you're saying is true, my recent improvement was due to this so-called 'false recovery' caused by Ebenholz and Kreide. And as soon as this phase is over, I'll become critically ill and my life will be in danger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. You've been around them a lot, so the symptoms will also be a lot more pronounced."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Others who've had less contact with them are also affected, and if I let the two of them play together, there's a high possibility that people will die?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Correct. Even though I don't know the exact reason, having the two play together seems to amplify the effect they have on their surroundings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How likely are we talking about here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't say for sure right now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Other than me, who else is in life-threatening danger?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Over a dozen people from the Afterglow have already been hospitalized in the Cliffy Patio."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Cliffy Patio... In other words, they've already left Ebenholz and Kreide's effective range?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That should be the case."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then I have a clear picture of the situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your answer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...is no."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not asking you to cancel the whole concert. You can just cut Ebenholz and Kreide's part, or even have someone else perform the duet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you can prove that their duet will cause harm to people other than me, then I'll cancel the concert right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But it seems that's not the case. Even you have no idea what would happen if they played together. I can't simply throw away the efforts and aspirations of everyone in the Afterglow over these illusory 'concerns.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The efforts and aspirations...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand how much this concert means to you, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't understand anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you truly understood, you wouldn't throw around the word 'but' so lightly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Unfortunately, I cannot change the concert schedule on your word alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mr. Czerny, please give me a straight answer. What makes this concert more important than the lives of the Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you suggesting that I'm disregarding peoples' lives?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just saying––"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursula",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hibiscus! Hibiscus!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ms. Ursula?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursula",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come take a little stroll, won't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursula",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ursula",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's head out and calm down first. We can talk about this later, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(If everything Gertrude said is true, then Kreide won't survive this.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(No, there must be some way... Some way to come out ahead on both fronts...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Czerny, Czerny must know something...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(No, he's just a musician, he won't be able to help.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Should I tell Kreide the truth––)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(But what good would that do?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Rhodes Island...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Someone like Hibiscus is only going to send me back to my cell in Urtica!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(The Empresses' Voice?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(What am I even thinking? Is this a suicide mission?!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(No, I've been going in circles. I'm standing out too much. I need to go somewhere less crowded.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Huh? Have I seen that man before?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suspicious Infected",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Definitely... the crowd."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Right, the rumor. There was that rumor!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(I've got to get to the bottom of this rumor. Who knows, there might even be some clues, or the person spreading the rumor might know something!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(But it's all up to me at this point...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suspicious Infected",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is the best opportunity we're going to get."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suspicious Infected",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The longer things drag on, the less time we'll have. It'll only make things harder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, hurry it up then. I'll go report to the higher-ups. I'm counting on you, Herr Lachmann."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lachmann",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
